{
  "id": "u39",
  "section": 5,
  "order": 7,
  "title": "Hosting at home",
  "teTitle": "ఇంటికి రండి",
  "cefr": "B1",
  "register": "standard",
  "description": "Welcome guests, survive the loving food-insistence dance, and leave with a box of leftovers.",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "u39-i01",
      "te": "రండి రండి, లోపలికి రండి!",
      "gloss": "Come, come, come inside!",
      "words": [
        { "te": "రండి", "gloss": "come (polite)" },
        { "te": "రండి", "gloss": "come (repeated warmth)" },
        { "te": "లోపలికి", "gloss": "inside" },
        { "te": "రండి", "gloss": "come (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "welcome"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "note": "Doubling the word doubles the warmth: రండి రండి! One రండి is an invitation; two is a welcome.",
      "distractors": ["u39-i03", "u39-i15"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i02",
      "te": "ఇల్లు వెంటనే దొరికిందా?",
      "gloss": "Did you find the house easily?",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇల్లు", "gloss": "house" },
        { "te": "వెంటనే", "gloss": "right away" },
        { "te": "దొరికిందా", "gloss": "was it found?" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "welcome", "questions"],
      "difficulty": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i03",
      "te": "ముందు కాఫీ తాగండి.",
      "gloss": "First, have some coffee.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ముందు", "gloss": "first" },
        { "te": "కాఫీ", "gloss": "coffee" },
        { "te": "తాగండి", "gloss": "drink (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "food"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u39-i01", "u39-i05"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i04",
      "te": "భోజనం చేసే వెళ్ళాలి మీరు.",
      "gloss": "You must eat before you leave.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "భోజనం", "gloss": "meal" },
        { "te": "చేసే", "gloss": "only after doing" },
        { "te": "వెళ్ళాలి", "gloss": "must go" },
        { "te": "మీరు", "gloss": "you (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "food"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "Non-negotiable in a Telugu home: leaving without eating simply isn't an available option. చేసే = చేసి + emphatic ఏ, 'only after eating'.",
      "distractors": ["u39-i05", "u39-i11"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i05",
      "te": "ఇంకొంచెం అన్నం వేసుకోండి.",
      "gloss": "Take a little more rice.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఇంకొంచెం", "gloss": "a little more" },
        { "te": "అన్నం", "gloss": "rice" },
        { "te": "వేసుకోండి", "gloss": "serve yourself (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "food"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u39-i06", "u39-i11"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i06",
      "te": "అయ్యో, ఇంకా ఏమీ తినలేదు మీరు!",
      "gloss": "Oh no, you've hardly eaten anything!",
      "words": [
        { "te": "అయ్యో", "gloss": "oh no" },
        { "te": "ఇంకా", "gloss": "yet / still" },
        { "te": "ఏమీ", "gloss": "anything" },
        { "te": "తినలేదు", "gloss": "haven't eaten" },
        { "te": "మీరు", "gloss": "you (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "food"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "Said over a plate you've refilled twice. It's not an observation — it's love, expressed as concern about your appetite.",
      "distractors": ["u39-i05", "u39-i10"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i07",
      "te": "కడుపు నిండా తిన్నాను, ప్రామిస్!",
      "gloss": "I've eaten to a full stomach, promise!",
      "words": [
        { "te": "కడుపు", "gloss": "stomach" },
        { "te": "నిండా", "gloss": "full" },
        { "te": "తిన్నాను", "gloss": "I ate" },
        { "te": "ప్రామిస్", "gloss": "promise" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "food", "guest"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u39-i12", "u39-i08"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i08",
      "te": "వంట చాలా బాగుంది.",
      "gloss": "The food is really good.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "వంట", "gloss": "the cooking" },
        { "te": "చాలా", "gloss": "very" },
        { "te": "బాగుంది", "gloss": "is good" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "compliments", "guest"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u39-i09", "u39-i16"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i09",
      "te": "ఈ పులిహోర అదిరిపోయింది!",
      "gloss": "This pulihora is out of this world!",
      "words": [
        { "te": "ఈ", "gloss": "this" },
        { "te": "పులిహోర", "gloss": "pulihora (tamarind rice)" },
        { "te": "అదిరిపోయింది", "gloss": "is stunning" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "compliments", "guest"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u39-i08", "u39-i16"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i10",
      "te": "మొహమాటం పడకండి.",
      "gloss": "Don't hold back out of politeness.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మొహమాటం", "gloss": "polite hesitation" },
        { "te": "పడకండి", "gloss": "don't fall into (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "culture"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "మొహమాటం — the polite reluctance to accept more — has no English equivalent. Hosts wage a loving war against it."
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i11",
      "te": "కొంచెం తీసుకోండి, నా మాట వినండి.",
      "gloss": "Take a little — listen to me.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "కొంచెం", "gloss": "a little" },
        { "te": "తీసుకోండి", "gloss": "take (polite)" },
        { "te": "నా", "gloss": "my" },
        { "te": "మాట", "gloss": "word" },
        { "te": "వినండి", "gloss": "listen (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "food"],
      "difficulty": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i12",
      "te": "సరే, చివరిసారి వేయండి.",
      "gloss": "Alright, serve me one last time.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "సరే", "gloss": "alright" },
        { "te": "చివరిసారి", "gloss": "last time" },
        { "te": "వేయండి", "gloss": "serve (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "food", "guest"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "The guest's graceful surrender. Everyone knows 'last time' means at least two more servings."
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i13",
      "te": "వెళ్ళేటప్పుడు స్వీట్లు పట్టుకెళ్ళండి.",
      "gloss": "Take some sweets when you go.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "వెళ్ళేటప్పుడు", "gloss": "while leaving" },
        { "te": "స్వీట్లు", "gloss": "sweets" },
        { "te": "పట్టుకెళ్ళండి", "gloss": "carry along (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "leftovers"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u39-i14", "u39-i15"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i14",
      "te": "డబ్బాలో కొంచెం కూర పెట్టాను.",
      "gloss": "I packed a little curry in a box.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "డబ్బాలో", "gloss": "in a box" },
        { "te": "కొంచెం", "gloss": "a little" },
        { "te": "కూర", "gloss": "curry" },
        { "te": "పెట్టాను", "gloss": "I put" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "leftovers"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "distractors": ["u39-i13", "u39-i03"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i15",
      "te": "మళ్ళీ తప్పకుండా రండి.",
      "gloss": "Do come again, without fail.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మళ్ళీ", "gloss": "again" },
        { "te": "తప్పకుండా", "gloss": "without fail" },
        { "te": "రండి", "gloss": "come (polite)" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "farewell"],
      "difficulty": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "u39-i16",
      "te": "మీ ఇల్లు చాలా బాగుంది.",
      "gloss": "Your home is lovely.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "మీ", "gloss": "your (polite)" },
        { "te": "ఇల్లు", "gloss": "house" },
        { "te": "చాలా", "gloss": "very" },
        { "te": "బాగుంది", "gloss": "is nice" }
      ],
      "tags": ["hosting", "compliments", "guest"],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "distractors": ["u39-i08", "u39-i09"]
    }
  ],
